{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超訪問北京和上海。</p>\n<p>行政長官李家超下午抵達北京，他將出席周三上午舉行的京港洽談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面；同日轉往上海，周四出席進博會開幕式，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭，周五返港。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:58.957569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.180908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:51.441841+00:00","content_hash":"616d6ddbfc7fcbf330874076c4f5359bd6138d49d9690c05edf495d0529ee3ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:58.957569+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}